        "aiSupplement": {
          "explanation": [
            {
              "text": "In <i>pV</i> = <i>nRT</i> with <i>R</i> = 8.31 J K<sup>–1</sup> mol<sup>–1</sup>, the units must be SI: pressure in Pa, volume in m<sup>3</sup> and temperature in K. Here the volume is already in m<sup>3</sup>, so the two conversions needed are 103 kPa = 103 000 Pa and 60 °C = 333 K.",
              "refs": [
                "syllabus:4.1(3)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "n = (103 000 × 5.37 × 10<sup>–3</sup>) ÷ (8.31 × 333) = 553.1 ÷ 2767 = 0.200 mol. Mass = 0.200 × 16.0 = 3.2 g.",
              "refs": [
                "syllabus:4.1(3)",
                "syllabus:2.4(1)"
              ]
            }
          ],
